/target
**/*.rs.bk
/data
*.log
.venv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
chain/
.freebuff/

# Node data and key material. `wallets.json` (and its `--wallet-file`
# equivalents) holds encrypted keys; the `.tmp` companion is what
# `wallet_store::write_private` builds before the atomic rename, so a crash can
# leave one behind holding plaintext key bytes. Neither belongs in git.
*.tmp
*.temp
wallets.json
*.json.tmp
*.pem
*.pkcs12

# Rust profiling / coverage artifacts from `-C instrument-coverage` and the
# ASan fuzz campaign.
*.profraw
*.profdata
.lcov.info
coverage/
tarpaulin-report.html

# Editor and OS cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
